7. REAL WORLD SCEnarios:

i. If I have a single Python file having 10 test cases and I want to skip 8 test cases.
Is it possible with Selenium in Python?

ii. What is Pytest? open source automation tool, Fixtures, reports, parallel testing.
Example: 10 test cases to be executed on two browsers (Not possible only with Selenium)
You need-> Batch testing: bunch of test cases, whenever we need a new version,
Bunch test is executed to generate a report.
If the bunch of test cases are passes only then we accept the version of the Webpage.
This is done by Pytest. (pip install pytest)

